# SSH client configuration
#
# This file is managed by chezmoi (permissions 0600 via private_ prefix).
# Private keys are NOT stored here and are intentionally not managed by
# chezmoi -- provision those out-of-band on each machine.

Host *
    AddKeysToAgent yes

